    "title": "Lifted White Lexus Suspect Sought After Venice Boulevard Hit-and-Run Hurts Two - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ben Levine ,\n1 days ago Venice Blvd. & Abbot Kinney Blvd. — Reported Pedestrian Strike Intersection. Two pedestrians were crossing Venice Boulevard in a marked crosswalk at Abbot Kinney Boulevard when a white Lexus SUV slammed into them and sped off, leaving one victim critically injured; both were taken to a hospital, and Los Angeles police are searching for a driver described as a man in his late 20s. The crash happened at roughly 9:10 a.m. on September 5, according to police details. Read full article",
